ue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717", "id": 3577284982, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7VOQl2", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:36:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-25T19:36:49Z", "body": "This means that your autopilot doesn't seem to support MAVLink mission messages of the _INT type.\n\nThis is set here:\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/02df9d5a95dcc70c92b08e2db70f16e7dce91cc0/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp#L364-L365\n\nBased on the message AUTOPILOT_VERSION.\n\nWhat autopilot are you using? PX4, ArduPilot, something else?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3577284982/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3578879917", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717#issuecomment-3578879917", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717", "id": 3578879917, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7VUV-t", "user": {"login": "ButyAfter", "id": 83112426, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgzMTEyNDI2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83112426?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter", "html_url": "https://github.com/ButyAfter", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:42:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-26T03:42:49Z", "body": "> This means that your autopilot doesn't seem to support MAVLink mission messages of the _INT type.\n> \n> This is set here:\n> \n> [MAVSDK/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/02df9d5a95dcc70c92b08e2db70f16e7dce91cc0/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp#L364-L365)\n> \n> Lines 364 to 365 in [02df9d5](/mavlink/MAVSDK/commit/02df9d5a95dcc70c92b08e2db70f16e7dce91cc0)\n> \n>  _mission_transfer_client.set_int_messages_supported( \n>      autopilot_version.capabilities & MAV_PROTOCOL_CAPABILITY_MISSION_INT); \n> Based on the message AUTOPILOT_VERSION.\n> \n> What autopilot are you using? PX4, ArduPilot, something else?\n\n<img width=\"575\" height=\"169\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/276b0277-bb0c-4076-bd6b-425b4d130ead\" />\n\n\u662f\u8fd9\u7c7b\u578b\u7684\u3002\n\n\u7136\u540e\u6211\u5c1d\u8bd5\u7528\u8fd9\u4e2a\u65b9\u5f0f\u53ef\u4ee5\u4e0a\u4f20\u5e76\u6267\u884c\u4efb\u52a1\uff0c\u4f46\u662f\u8fd9\u79cd\u65b9\u5f0f\u6bd4\u8f83\u9ebb\u70e6\uff1a\n\n> String fieldsJson = String.format(\"\"\"\n                {\n                  \"command\": 44,\n                  \"count\": %d,\n                  \"target_system\": %d,\n                  \"target_component\": %d,\n                  \"mission_type\": %d,\n                  \"opaque_id\": %d\n                }\n                \"\"\", 6, 1, 1, 0, 0);\n\n        // \u521b\u5efa MAVLink \u6d88\u606f\u5bf9\u8c61\uff0c\u7c7b\u578b\u4e3a MISSION_COUNT\n        MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage msg = new MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage(\n                \"MISSION_COUNT\",  // \u6d88\u606f\u7c7b\u578b\n                255, 1, 1, 1,\n                fieldsJson         // \u6d88\u606f\u5185\u5bb9\uff1aJSON \u683c\u5f0f\u7684\u6570\u636e\n        );\n\n\n        drone.getMavlinkDirect().sendMessage(msg)\n                .doOnComplete(() -> log.info(\"\u2705 \u544a\u77e5\u4efb\u52a1\u6570\u91cf\u53d1\u9001\u6210\u529f\"))\n                .doOnError(err -> log.error(\"\u274c \u544a\u77e5\u4efb\u52a1\u6570\u91cf\u53d1\u9001\u5931\u8d25: {}\", err.getMessage()))\n                .blockingAwait();\n\n        String[] missionItems = new String[]{\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, \"NaN\"]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 260803509, 1192686235, 59.6, 0, 22, 1, 1, 3, 1, 1, 0, 59.6, 0.0, 10.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, %f]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 0, 0, 0.0, 1, 178, 1, 1, 2, 0, 1, 0, 1.0, 10.0, -1.0, 0.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, \"NaN\"]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 260804039, 1192686460, 59.6, 2, 16, 1, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, %f]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 0, 0, 0.0, 3, 178, 1, 1, 2, 0, 1, 0, 1.0, 10.0, -1.0, 0.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, \"NaN\"]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 260803966, 1192685666, 59.6, 4, 16, 1, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, \"NaN\"]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 260803562, 1192685866, 59.6, 5, 16, 1, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n        };\n\n// \u6784\u9020\u5e76\u53d1\u9001\u6bcf\u4e2a\u4efb\u52a1\u9879\u6d88\u606f\n        MavlinkDirect mavlinkDirect = drone.getMavlinkDirect();\n        for (int i = 0; i < missionItems.length; i++) {\n            MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage itemMsg = new MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage(\n                    \"MISSION_ITEM_INT\",  // \u6d88\u606f\u7c7b\u578b\n                    255, 1, 1, 1,        // \u7cfb\u7edf\u548c\u7ec4\u4ef6\u7684\u6807\u8bc6\u7b26\n                    missionItems[i]      // \u4efb\u52a1\u9879\u7684 JSON \u683c\u5f0f\u6570\u636e\n            );\n\n            // \u53d1\u9001\u6d88\u606f\n            int index = i;\n            mavlinkDirect.sendMessage(itemMsg)\n                    .doOnComplete(() -> log.info(\"\u2705 \u4efb\u52a1\u9879 {} \u53d1\u9001\u6210\u529f\", index))\n                    .doOnError(err -> log.error(\"\u274c \u4efb\u52a1\u9879 {} \u53d1\u9001\u5931\u8d25: {}\", index, err.getMessage()))\n                    .blockingAwait();  // \u963b\u585e\u7b49\u5f85\u76f4\u5230\u4efb\u52a1\u53d1\u9001\u5b8c\u6210\n        }\n\n\n\n\n\n        // \u6267\u884c\n        int customMode = 67371008;  // custom_mode\n        int baseMode = 81;          // base_mode\n        int targetSystem = 1;       // \u76ee\u6807\u7cfb\u7edf\n        int targetComponent = 1;    // \u76ee\u6807\u7ec4\u4ef6\n\n        // \u6784\u9020 SET_MODE \u6d88\u606f\u7684 JSON \u6570\u636e\n        String setModeJson = String.format(\"\"\"\n                {\n                  \"custom_mode\": %d,\n                  \"target_system\": %d,\n                  \"base_mode\": %d\n                }\n                \"\"\", customMode, targetSystem, baseMode);\n\n// \u521b\u5efa MAVLink \u6d88\u606f\u5bf9\u8c61\uff0c\u7c7b\u578b\u4e3a SET_MODE\n        MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage exeMsg = new MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage(\n                \"SET_MODE\",           // \u6d88\u606f\u7c7b\u578b\n                255,                  // \u7cfb\u7edfID\n                1,                    // \u7ec4\u4ef6ID\n                1,                    // \u76ee\u6807\u7cfb\u7edf\n                1,                    // \u76ee\u6807\u7ec4\u4ef6\n                setModeJson           // \u6d88\u606f\u5185\u5bb9\uff08JSON \u683c\u5f0f\u6570\u636e\uff09\n        );\n\n// \u53d1\u9001\u6d88\u606f\n        drone.getMavlinkDirect().sendMessage(exeMsg)\n                .doOnComplete(() -> log.info(\"\u2705 SET_MODE \u6d88\u606f\u53d1\u9001\u6210\u529f\"))\n                .doOnError(err -> log.error(\"\u274c SET_MODE \u6d88\u606f\u53d1\u9001\u5931\u8d25: {}\", err.getMessage()))\n                .blockingAwait();  // \u963b\u585e\u7b49\u5f85\u76f4\u5230\u4efb\u52a1\u53d1\u9001\u5b8c\u6210\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3578879917/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3583757507", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717#issuecomment-3583757507", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717", "id": 3583757507, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7Vm8zD", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:06:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-27T01:06:00Z", "body": "I'm not sure I can help with ACFLY I'm afraid. Never heard of this.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3583757507/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3599796889", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717#issuecomment-3599796889", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717", "id": 3599796889, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7WkIqZ", "user": {"login": "ButyAfter", "id": 83112426, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgzMTEyNDI2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83112426?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter", "html_url": "https://github.com/ButyAfter", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:55:53Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-02T01:55:53Z", "body": "> I'm not sure I can help with ACFLY I'm afraid. Never heard of this.\n\n\u597d\u5427\uff0c\u8fd9\u662f\u4f7f\u7528mavsdk\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\uff1a\nMission.MissionPlan missionPlan = new Mission.MissionPlan(missionItems);\n        drone.getMission().uploadMission(missionPlan)\n                .andThen(drone.getMission().startMission())\n                .subscribe(\n                        () -> log.info(\"Mission started successfully\"),\n                        throwable -> log.error(\"Mission start failed: {}\", throwable.getMessage())\n                );\n\n\n\u6211\u60f3\u77e5\u9053\u8fd9\u4e2a\u65b9\u5f0f\u548c\u4f7f\u7528MavlinkDirect\u6267\u884c\u4efb\u52a1\u65b9\u5f0f\u6709\u5565\u533a\u522b\u5462\u3002\u56e0\u4e3a\u4f7f\u7528\u8fd9\u4e2a\u65b9\u5f0f\u62a5\u9519\uff0c\u4f46\u662f\u4f7f\u7528MavlinkDirect\u4e0d\u4f1a\u3002", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3599796889/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3600197235", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717#issuecomment-3600197235", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717", "id": 3600197235, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7WlqZz", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:59:46Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-02T04:59:46Z", "body": "The mission plugin does the mission transfer implementation for you. It only supports the _INT messages. If your autopilot doesn't set the capability bit correctly, there is not much mavsdk can do.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3600197235/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}], "timeline": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3577284982", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717#issuecomment-3577284982", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717", "id": 3577284982, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7VOQl2", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:36:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-25T19:36:49Z", "body": "This means that your autopilot doesn't seem to support MAVLink mission messages of the _INT type.\n\nThis is set here:\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/02df9d5a95dcc70c92b08e2db70f16e7dce91cc0/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp#L364-L365\n\nBased on the message AUTOPILOT_VERSION.\n\nWhat autopilot are you using? PX4, ArduPilot, something else?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3577284982/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3578879917", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717#issuecomment-3578879917", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2717", "id": 3578879917, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7VUV-t", "user": {"login": "ButyAfter", "id": 83112426, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgzMTEyNDI2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83112426?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter", "html_url": "https://github.com/ButyAfter", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:42:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-26T03:42:49Z", "body": "> This means that your autopilot doesn't seem to support MAVLink mission messages of the _INT type.\n> \n> This is set here:\n> \n> [MAVSDK/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/02df9d5a95dcc70c92b08e2db70f16e7dce91cc0/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp#L364-L365)\n> \n> Lines 364 to 365 in [02df9d5](/mavlink/MAVSDK/commit/02df9d5a95dcc70c92b08e2db70f16e7dce91cc0)\n> \n>  _mission_transfer_client.set_int_messages_supported( \n>      autopilot_version.capabilities & MAV_PROTOCOL_CAPABILITY_MISSION_INT); \n> Based on the message AUTOPILOT_VERSION.\n> \n> What autopilot are you using? PX4, ArduPilot, something else?\n\n<img width=\"575\" height=\"169\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/276b0277-bb0c-4076-bd6b-425b4d130ead\" />\n\n\u662f\u8fd9\u7c7b\u578b\u7684\u3002\n\n\u7136\u540e\u6211\u5c1d\u8bd5\u7528\u8fd9\u4e2a\u65b9\u5f0f\u53ef\u4ee5\u4e0a\u4f20\u5e76\u6267\u884c\u4efb\u52a1\uff0c\u4f46\u662f\u8fd9\u79cd\u65b9\u5f0f\u6bd4\u8f83\u9ebb\u70e6\uff1a\n\n> String fieldsJson = String.format(\"\"\"\n                {\n                  \"command\": 44,\n                  \"count\": %d,\n                  \"target_system\": %d,\n                  \"target_component\": %d,\n                  \"mission_type\": %d,\n                  \"opaque_id\": %d\n                }\n                \"\"\", 6, 1, 1, 0, 0);\n\n        // \u521b\u5efa MAVLink \u6d88\u606f\u5bf9\u8c61\uff0c\u7c7b\u578b\u4e3a MISSION_COUNT\n        MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage msg = new MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage(\n                \"MISSION_COUNT\",  // \u6d88\u606f\u7c7b\u578b\n                255, 1, 1, 1,\n                fieldsJson         // \u6d88\u606f\u5185\u5bb9\uff1aJSON \u683c\u5f0f\u7684\u6570\u636e\n        );\n\n\n        drone.getMavlinkDirect().sendMessage(msg)\n                .doOnComplete(() -> log.info(\"\u2705 \u544a\u77e5\u4efb\u52a1\u6570\u91cf\u53d1\u9001\u6210\u529f\"))\n                .doOnError(err -> log.error(\"\u274c \u544a\u77e5\u4efb\u52a1\u6570\u91cf\u53d1\u9001\u5931\u8d25: {}\", err.getMessage()))\n                .blockingAwait();\n\n        String[] missionItems = new String[]{\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, \"NaN\"]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 260803509, 1192686235, 59.6, 0, 22, 1, 1, 3, 1, 1, 0, 59.6, 0.0, 10.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, %f]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 0, 0, 0.0, 1, 178, 1, 1, 2, 0, 1, 0, 1.0, 10.0, -1.0, 0.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, \"NaN\"]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 260804039, 1192686460, 59.6, 2, 16, 1, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, %f]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 0, 0, 0.0, 3, 178, 1, 1, 2, 0, 1, 0, 1.0, 10.0, -1.0, 0.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, \"NaN\"]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 260803966, 1192685666, 59.6, 4, 16, 1, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0),\n\n                String.format(\"\"\"\n            {\n              \"x\": %d,\n              \"y\": %d,\n              \"z\": %f,\n              \"seq\": %d,\n              \"command\": %d,\n              \"target_system\": %d,\n              \"target_component\": %d,\n              \"frame\": %d,\n              \"current\": %d,\n              \"autocontinue\": %d,\n              \"mission_type\": %d,\n              \"param\": [%f, %f, %f, \"NaN\"]\n            }\n            \"\"\", 260803562, 1192685866, 59.6, 5, 16, 1, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n        };\n\n// \u6784\u9020\u5e76\u53d1\u9001\u6bcf\u4e2a\u4efb\u52a1\u9879\u6d88\u606f\n        MavlinkDirect mavlinkDirect = drone.getMavlinkDirect();\n        for (int i = 0; i < missionItems.length; i++) {\n            MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage itemMsg = new MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage(\n                    \"MISSION_ITEM_INT\",  // \u6d88\u606f\u7c7b\u578b\n                    255, 1, 1, 1,        // \u7cfb\u7edf\u548c\u7ec4\u4ef6\u7684\u6807\u8bc6\u7b26\n                    missionItems[i]      // \u4efb\u52a1\u9879\u7684 JSON \u683c\u5f0f\u6570\u636e\n            );\n\n            // \u53d1\u9001\u6d88\u606f\n            int index = i;\n            mavlinkDirect.sendMessage(itemMsg)\n                    .doOnComplete(() -> log.info(\"\u2705 \u4efb\u52a1\u9879 {} \u53d1\u9001\u6210\u529f\", index))\n                    .doOnError(err -> log.error(\"\u274c \u4efb\u52a1\u9879 {} \u53d1\u9001\u5931\u8d25: {}\", index, err.getMessage()))\n                    .blockingAwait();  // \u963b\u585e\u7b49\u5f85\u76f4\u5230\u4efb\u52a1\u53d1\u9001\u5b8c\u6210\n        }\n\n\n\n\n\n        // \u6267\u884c\n        int customMode = 67371008;  // custom_mode\n        int baseMode = 81;          // base_mode\n        int targetSystem = 1;       // \u76ee\u6807\u7cfb\u7edf\n        int targetComponent = 1;    // \u76ee\u6807\u7ec4\u4ef6\n\n        // \u6784\u9020 SET_MODE \u6d88\u606f\u7684 JSON \u6570\u636e\n        String setModeJson = String.format(\"\"\"\n                {\n                  \"custom_mode\": %d,\n                  \"target_system\": %d,\n                  \"base_mode\": %d\n                }\n                \"\"\", customMode, targetSystem, baseMode);\n\n// \u521b\u5efa MAVLink \u6d88\u606f\u5bf9\u8c61\uff0c\u7c7b\u578b\u4e3a SET_MODE\n        MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage exeMsg = new MavlinkDirect.MavlinkMessage(\n                \"SET_MODE\",           // \u6d88\u606f\u7c7b\u578b\n                255,                  // \u7cfb\u7edfID\n                1,                    // \u7ec4\u4ef6ID\n                1,                    // \u76ee\u6807\u7cfb\u7edf\n                1,                    // \u76ee\u6807\u7ec4\u4ef6\n                setModeJson           // \u6d88\u606f\u5185\u5bb9\uff08JSON \u683c\u5f0f\u6570\u636e\uff09\n        );\n\n// \u53d1\u9001\u6d88\u606f\n        drone.getMavlinkDirect().sendMessage(exeMsg)\n                .doOnComplete(() -> log.info(\"\u2705 SET_MODE \u6d88\u606f\u53d1\u9001\u6210\u529f\"))\n                .doOnError(err -> log.error(\"\u274c SET_MODE \u6d88\u606f\u53d1\u9001\u5931\u8d25: {}\", err.getMessage()))\n                .blockingAwait();  // \u963b\u585e\u7b49\u5f85\u76f4\u5230\u4efb\u52a1\u53d1\u9001\u5b8c\u6210\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3578879917/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "ButyAfter", "id": 83112426, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgzMTEyNDI2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83112426?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter", "html_url": "https://github.com/ButyAfter", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ButyAfter/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https